  <item>
    <title>EP01 凌晨两点半，我收到了裁员通知…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658d9f74ce7b77ef729cd796</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658d9f74ce7b77ef729cd796</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Dec 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>📢 本期值班主播：</span></strong><span>小时 &amp; 吴姐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔑 今日大厂访客：</span></strong><span>黎导｜可可｜王老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>👂 </span><strong><span>你会听到</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 吴姐：回忆多年前被裁员突击的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 王老师：毫无防备地收到“中奖”通知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 冷静分析裁员条款、做好一切交接，却在同事的一声问候中破防</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 黎导：在印尼爬火山的旅途中收到裁员通知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 裁员潮中如何向受影响的同事表达关心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> 可可：凌晨两点半，我收到了裁员通知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a> 学着接受大家的善意和赞美，把它们转为力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> 一些因祸得“福”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3199">53:19</a> 失业中年人的残酷现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3667">1:01:07</a> 如果你将要或正在经历裁员，这里有一些过来人的tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3927">1:05:27</a> New Year New Me 新年展望</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Music Credit</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>🎵 Better Tomorrow - Tokyo Music Walker</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv2g_IDDZDgO59xEce0CqrpfH-2r.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>*本图由Bard生成，代表三位主播向大家恭祝新年快乐，新的一年再无裁员！</span></em></p>]]></description>
